  <name>Permaplans</name>
  <summary>Design and manage biodiverse, useful gardens</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      Permaplans helps you design and manage useful, biodiverse land and gardens
      using permaculture principles. Plan garden beds, place and track your
      plants, and turn empty space into a productive, resilient ecosystem.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Visual garden and bed planning with an interactive map</li>
      <li>A rich plant database with photos, care notes and companion info</li>
      <li>Harvest and task tracking to manage your garden through the seasons</li>
      <li>Offline-first: core planning works without an internet connection</li>
      <li>Plant identification and community features to learn and share</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">com.permaplans.Permaplans.desktop</launchable>

